          "https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.ttest_rel.html"
        ],
        "use": "Documentation of paired within-sample assignment permutations and the paired t statistic; numeric inputs are authored here, not extracted from SciPy examples."
      }
    }
